User Browser
     │
     ▼
 OpenShift Route
     │
     ▼
  php-svc (Service)
     │
     ▼
   php-app Pod
     │
     ▼
 mysql-service
     │
     ▼
 mysql-app Pod
________________________________________
Key Concepts From This Lab
Concept	Explanation
Deployment	Creates and manages pods
Environment Variables	Required configuration for containers
Service	Internal communication between pods
Route	External access to applications
oc exec / oc rsh	Access container shell
Logs	Used to troubleshoot container failures

